>Hello Greg/Jonathan,
>
>On Linus's Tree with the tailing CONFIG file, i observe the following buil=
d error on PPC64:
>
>drivers/staging/iio/industrialio-core.c: In function =EF=BF=BD=EF=BF=BD=EF=
=BF=BDiio_event_getfd=EF=BF=BD=EF=BF=BD=EF=BF=BD:
>drivers/staging/iio/industrialio-core.c:262: error: =EF=BF=BD=EF=BF=BD=EF=
=BF=BDev_int=EF=BF=BD=EF=BF=BD=EF=BF=BD undeclared (first use in this funct=
ion)
>drivers/staging/iio/industrialio-core.c:262: error: (Each undeclared ident=
ifier is reported only once
>drivers/staging/iio/industrialio-core.c:262: error: for each function it a=
ppears in.)
>make[3]: *** [drivers/staging/iio/industrialio-core.o] Error 1
>
>The below patch fixes the same.
>
>Signed-off-by: Subrata Modak <subrata@linux.vnet.ibm.com>
>---
>
